{"nodes": [{"id": "_github_workflows_deploy_deploy_job", "label": "Calculator deploy job", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".github/workflows/deploy.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Three triggers: push (source changed), schedule (base image aged), dispatch (switchover). Image is smoke-tested and scanned before a byte reaches a registry; concurrency queues and never cancels because a half-applied Cloud Run deploy is worse than a slow one. Skips rather than fails when GCP is unprovisioned so a red tick is not trained to be ignored."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_deploy_realm_guard", "label": "Manifest realm deploy guard", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".github/workflows/deploy.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reads baseUrl realms out of forge/manifest.yml and asserts each points at a service this run deployed. Declared realm with no deployment fails (stale calculator answering a customer); deployed region with no realm only warns (money, not correctness)."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_deploy_workload_identity_federation", "label": "Workload Identity Federation deploy auth", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".github/workflows/deploy.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "GitHub mints a short-lived OIDC token and Google exchanges it, so no service account key lives in the repository to leak or rotate."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_deploy_weekly_rebuild", "label": "Weekly rebuild that deploys", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".github/workflows/deploy.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Base is python:3.12-slim plus one wheel so the attack surface is the base, which ages on its own schedule. A weekly build that never ships leaves the running service ageing as fast as without it; weekly rather than daily because daily noise gets muted."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_deploy_v1_meta_401_probe", "label": "/v1/meta 401 post-deploy probe", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".github/workflows/deploy.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cloud Run's front end swallows the literal path /healthz and answers Google's own 404, so a healthy service looked dead on the first deploy. A 401 from /v1/meta proves routing, the container up, and authentication switched on at once; a 200 health endpoint would not catch a calculator that came up unauthenticated."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_deploy_regions", "label": "REGIONS named once", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".github/workflows/deploy.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "us-central1, europe-west3, europe-west2 set in one env var read by both the deploy loop and the summary; forgetting the loop leaves a declared realm pointing at a service that quietly stops receiving versions while every check stays green."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_deploy_auth_mode_switch", "label": "Auth mode chosen by FORGE_AUDIENCE", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".github/workflows/deploy.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "forge-token mode when the FORGE_AUDIENCE variable is set, shared-secret otherwise, so rollback is unsetting one variable rather than a code change under pressure. JWKS URL, issuer and nested tenant claim confirmed against Atlassian docs on 2026-08-25."}, {"id": "_github_workflows_deploy_cloud_run_flags", "label": "Cloud Run deploy flags", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".github/workflows/deploy.yml", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "min-instances=0 is the cost case; allow-unauthenticated because the invocation token is the gate, not IAM; concurrency=1 because CPU-bound CPython contends on the GIL and eight sequence calls would outlive the 25s token; timeout=30s just past Forge's 25s remote timeout."}], "edges": [{"source": "_github_workflows_deploy_deploy_job", "target": "service_smoke", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/deploy.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_deploy_deploy_job", "target": "service_scan", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/deploy.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_deploy_deploy_job", "target": "service_dockerfile", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/deploy.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_deploy_deploy_job", "target": "service_provision_gcp", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/deploy.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_deploy_realm_guard", "target": "forge_manifest", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/deploy.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_deploy_realm_guard", "target": "docs_adr_0030_the_manifest_commits_to_its_hostnames_and_realms_once", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".github/workflows/deploy.yml", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_github_workflows_deploy_regions", "target": "docs_adr_0030_the_manifest_commits_to_its_hostnames_and_realms_once", "rela